// Why one `(cell, scorer)` coordinate cannot be regraded by a job.
//
// A NEW enum rather than a reuse of `EvaluationScorerRetryIneligibilityV1`,
// because the two policies are inverses: the scorer retry accepts deterministic
// scorers and declines judges, and this verb accepts judges and declines
// everything else. One enum meaning both would make each value's absence
// ambiguous.
