	// executed (wave 35 lane C, `SS-11`).
	//
	// Distinct from COORDINATE_UNKNOWN at 5 for the same reason its scorer-retry
	// twin is: "does not exist" is the wrong sentence about a row the customer
	// can see. A suite verdict follows its members with no re-derivation step, so
